    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878460/extras/8cf4aeb3856062422cb9233db87170bf.poster.avif?t=1697645349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878460/extras/8cf4aeb3856062422cb9233db87170bf.webm?t=1697645349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878460/extras/8cf4aeb3856062422cb9233db87170bf.mp4?t=1697645349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Form your team with up to 5 friends in Task Force Gaming's\u00ae Protocol: Children of War and enjoy the unique variation for military shooters based on real experience of US Army Soldiers who fought in Afghanistan. Heavily influenced by real missions in Afghanistan and the Battle of Mogadishu, you can play against other real players in skirmish tactical modes such as Extraction and Attack/ Defend. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878460/extras/c84c8a74ccb3a051e88a0fc82db5d046.poster.avif?t=1697645349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878460/extras/c84c8a74ccb3a051e88a0fc82db5d046.webm?t=1697645349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878460/extras/c84c8a74ccb3a051e88a0fc82db5d046.mp4?t=1697645349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u27a1 Weapon Customization: 60+ Attachments<br>\u27a1 Fully customize your player<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878460/extras/a1ef3ea7b01e6b508f3ef6fb3e76db0e.avif?t=1697645349\" /></div><br>\u27a1 Protect your head with the HHV ATE Helmet by !<br><br><div clas